  "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-line;\">Kitchen Fusions is a family owned &amp; operated seasoning &amp; dip producer. With us, you can share the freshest &amp; most delicious seasonings &amp; dips, straight from our production facility to their door. We have 3 unique brands targeted at distinct customer types to ensure everyone can get exactly what they want. From classic rubs to gourmet dipping spices, we have it all!\r\n\r\nInstant Gourmet - The everyday, every way seasonings! Made in America, for America, perfect for turning your next meal Instantly Gourmet. WOW’ing home cooks &amp; backyard BBQ’s for almost 40 years.\r\n\r\nFusion Flavors - Founded on the idea that exotic &amp; delicious flavors don’t need to be complicated, a collection of rubs &amp; dipping/spice packets designed to impress.\r\n\r\nJodie’s Kitchen - Healthy before healthy was cool, these herb blends bring life to a variety of dishes! Each bottle contains no more than 1 tbsp salt or sugar, &amp; many have no salt or sugar at all.\r\n\r\nSince we make our own products, we are flexible on most everything. Let us know what you need &amp; we will be happy to work with you.\r\n\r\nAll of our products are made in our 100% solar powered facility in Greater Tampa Bay.</span><br></p><p>                                                </p>",
